WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 15 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:29.000
I've never seen a dragon wag its tail like a dog before.

2
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.080
Is Lord Magnus failing him out again?

3
00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:32.200
Gorgon!

4
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.840
What the hell are you doing?

5
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:36.160
Rip that blaspheter shreds!

6
00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:41.100
Woo!

7
00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:44.220
Is the boy carrying some kind of pharom extract?

8
00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:46.580
A mind-altering charm?

9
00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:51.700
It's the only logical explanation.

10
00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:53.620
Good boy, Gorgon.

11
00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:56.500
You remembered that wing I patched up, didn't you?

12
00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:57.780
See?

13
00:00:57.780 --> 00:00:59.420
I always knew you had a heart.

14
00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:00.420
Oh, thank God.

15
00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:03.060
Duke Valmont stopped him.

16
00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:04.980
Talk about lucky timing.

17
00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:05.980
Again.

18
00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:08.260
There's no way a peasant commands a war dragon.

19
00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:11.100
So he's just riding my father's coattails again.

20
00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:12.100
Dumb luck.

21
00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:13.500
Mordric?

22
00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:15.860
Is there a reason you're terrorizing my guest?

23
00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:17.380
This is sacred ground.

24
00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:20.820
The boy doesn't know his place, so I reminded him.

25
00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:22.420
And as one of the presiding judges,

26
00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:26.220
you're not only late and openly playing favorites.

27
00:01:26.220 --> 00:01:28.420
I simply believe we shouldn't be so harsh on the youth

28
00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:30.100
facing their first trial.

29
00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:32.540
I'm worried your little charity case is going to drag down

30
00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:34.660
the prestige of this entire trial.

31
00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:38.140
Duke Valmont, seriously, I have no right to be in this trial.

32
00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:39.740
Just being here to watch is an honor.

33
00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:40.700
Please don't fight him over me.

34
00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:41.620
Look at me, Aris.

35
00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:43.020
Do you want to be a dragon knight?

36
00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:44.500
Do you want to see what the future holds for you

37
00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:46.180
and that little guy?

38
00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:48.060
I don't break the ancient laws.

39
00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:49.660
Just let the boy take the trial.

40
00:01:49.660 --> 00:01:51.180
If the astrolabe says he's a dod,

41
00:01:51.180 --> 00:01:53.580
I will personally apologize to everyone present.

42
00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:55.660
If you are that desperate to humiliate yourself

43
00:01:55.660 --> 00:01:57.700
on this sacred ground, be my guest.
